      "mergedPostDetails": "I made an avatar that uses a cubemap to achieve a visual effect. (this is the only texture used in the avatar) When I went to check on the performance data, It showed that it only used 0.67 MB of texture memory. This is obviously incorrect, as the cubemap is a 1024x6144 texture, and a 2d texture with those dimensions would require a lot more memory.",
